      <reaction metaid="meta_ICGEX" sboTerm="SBO:0000655" id="ICGEX" name="ICG export (plasma)" reversible="false" compartment="Vli">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>Sinusoidal efflux of indocyanine green from the hepatocytes into the
plasma (the bidirectional transport of the OATPs, MRP3 (ABCC3)), first
order in the hepatic amount. It is the slow secondary phase of the
plasma curve after a bolus (Meijer1988: half-life 63 - 89 min).</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:vCard4="http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/" xmlns:bqmodel="http://biomodels.net/model-qualifiers/">
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="#meta_ICGEX">
              <bqbiol:isVersionOf>
                <rdf:Bag>
                  <rdf:li rdf:resource="https://identifiers.org/uniprot:O15438"/>
                </rdf:Bag>
              </bqbiol:isVersionOf>
            </rdf:Description>
          </rdf:RDF>
        </annotation>
        <listOfReactants>
          <speciesReference species="icg" stoichiometry="1" constant="true"/>
        </listOfReactants>
        <listOfProducts>
          <speciesReference species="icg_ext" stoichiometry="1" constant="true"/>
        </listOfProducts>
        <kineticLaw>
          <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <apply>
              <times/>
              <ci> ICGEX_k </ci>
              <ci> Vli </ci>
              <ci> icg </ci>
            </apply>
          </math>
        </kineticLaw>
      </reaction>
      <reaction metaid="meta_ICGLI2CA" sboTerm="SBO:0000655" id="ICGLI2CA" name="ICG export (bile)" reversible="false" compartment="Vli">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>Canalicular export of indocyanine green by the multidrug resistance
associated protein 2, MRP2 (ABCC2), saturable.</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:vCard4="http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/" xmlns:bqmodel="http://biomodels.net/model-qualifiers/">
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="#meta_ICGLI2CA">
              <bqbiol:is>
