      <reaction sboTerm="SBO:0000655" id="ICGLI2BI" name="ICG bile transport" reversible="false" compartment="Vbi">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>The transit of bile from the canaliculi through the bile ducts, first
order in the amount in bile, i.e. the excretion of indocyanine green
with the bile; as simplification directly into the feces.</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
